// For the controls on a phone: a figure's one param, as radios too long for its bar held upright,
// which fit it turned.
doc wide
param mode "projection" in {"stereographic": 1, "orthographic": 2, "gnomonic": 3, "equal area": 4}
viewport { x: -2..2, y: -2..2 }
circles c = circle(0, 0.1·k·mode) for k in 1..4
